- Spend time with friends and family who support you; 
- Engage in activities that make you happy; 
- Create a self-care routine; 
- Avoid contact with your ex if possible; 
- Practice self-compassion and understanding; 
- Focus on the future instead of dwelling on the past; 
- Consider professional counselling if needed.user

